# CMB Anomalies Catalogue (large-scale structural anomalies).
# Each line below is one MPR row data block (NDJSON).
# Lines starting with "#" or empty lines are skipped by the
# literature_curated adapter.
#
# Six canonical anomalies, each established across WMAP (2003-2010)
# and re-confirmed in Planck 2018 VII (Akrami et al. 2020 A&A 641:A7,
# doi:10.1051/0004-6361/201833881). These anomalies-as-data are
# uncontroversial in the CMB literature; their INTERPRETATION
# (statistical fluke, residual systematics, or new physics) remains
# the open scientific question. This catalogue is DATA, not
# interpretation.
#
# precision_flag = "test_dependent" reflects the well-known
# observation that significance estimates for CMB anomalies vary
# meaningfully across statistical tests; reported sigma values are
# representative of the cited principal reference.

